    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary: Green Food",
      "",
      "Today in class, the teacher told us to eat green food.",
      "I was confused. If I eat green things every day, will I turn into the Green Hulk? Then I don’t dare to eat any.",
      "In the evening I went to the supermarket and asked the worker: “Do you have green food here?”",
      "The worker pointed to the vegetables nearby and said: “All these are green food.”",
      "He also told me that “green food” means healthy food without pollution.",
      ""
